    "notes": "Fixed assets tax book reference data for Kenyan companies (docs/modules/fixed-assets.md FA-20): the Income Tax Act Second Schedule classes, each with its method and annual rate. Owner decision 2026-10-22: the researched rates are used at medium confidence (the consolidated Act and PwC agree; not confirmed by an accountant); the year-of-acquisition rule is low confidence (an inference). The Second Schedule states every rate 'per year, in equal instalments' (straight line) or as a first-year rate; first_year_rate is the rate the year an asset enters service, then rate applies to the residue. A class with a null method or rate, or needs_confirmation true, is unconfirmed and the tax book is refused. Labels live in lang/{locale}/fixed_assets.php (tax_classes.*).",
